On the mistake-o-meter, I would say that ranks as a 9 out of 10.

Theres really no reason to have an unIDed wand of polymorph.

You should use Engraveing to ID a good number of your wands (Strikeing, 
Magic Missle, Fire, Cold, Lightning, Polymorph, Digging, Enlightenment, 
Light, Wishing)(Did I miss any?) the wands that don't engrave ID at all 
tend to be the least useful. Engrave IDing is also a good way to prevent 
sticking a wand of cancelation into your BoH.

Nethack is not a game to be stingy in. The first time you die with a 
unIDed wand of wishing in your inventory you'll realize that.

